   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "698246b2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The missing-value tables show which fields are incomplete and how often. Review rows without text or sentiment cannot contribute to the sentiment summary. They remain in `reviews_raw` for the quality report but are excluded from sentiment calculations.\n",
    "\n",
    "Repeated app names are handled after exact duplicates and malformed rows are inspected. If the same app has multiple metadata rows, the latest available update date is selected for a one-row-per-app analysis copy. This is a documented selection rule, not a claim that the retained metadata is current today.\n",
    "\n",
    "The validity checks cover completeness, consistency, plausible ranges, duplicate records, and key integrity. The install-format check expects a digit group followed by `+`, matching the rounded bands in this file. Repeated review examples are displayed so duplicates are investigated rather than silently dropped. The raw review table is retained because identical text can reflect an export duplicate or a repeated response."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6c667982",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Feature engineering and app catalog cleaning\n",
    "\n",
    "The app fields contain formatted values that need careful conversion. Install values such as `1,000+` are converted to a numeric lower-bound estimate; this is not an exact install count. Prices remove the dollar sign, sizes in kilobytes are converted to megabytes, and values such as `Varies with device` become missing.\n",
    "\n",
    "Additional useful features include the number of genres listed, whether an app is free, and the year and month of its last update. Each feature is derived from existing columns. Invalid or missing source values are not guessed.\n",
    "\n",
    "For integration, exact duplicate catalog rows are removed in a working copy, clearly malformed rows and missing app names are excluded, and the most recently updated row is retained for each app name. The number of affected rows is reported."
   ]
  },
