   "source": [
    "The cleaned analysis table has one row per app name. The selected row is the one with the most recent parseable update date among duplicate-name records. Exact duplicate rows and the malformed row are handled separately, and the raw table remains unchanged.\n",
    "\n",
    "Install values are lower bounds from rounded bands such as `10,000+`. Price, size, and review counts may still be missing or invalid after conversion. These limits are preserved in the derived columns rather than filled with invented values."
