   "source": [
    "## 8. Grouping, aggregation, and transformation\n",
    "\n",
    "Apps are grouped by category. The summary calculates the number of app names, median rating, median install lower bound, mean price, and paid-app share. The aggregation creates one row per category.\n",
    "\n",
    "The `transform()` example returns the category's mean rating to each app row. This preserves the row count and allows each app's rating to be compared with its category average. A bar chart compares app counts for the largest categories."
   ]
