   "source": [
    "## 17. Outlier detection and treatment\n",
    "\n",
    "Install lower-bound estimates are strongly skewed, so outlier detection is performed on `log_installs`, the base-10 logarithm of the install lower bound plus one. The IQR method uses Q1 - 1.5 x IQR and Q3 + 1.5 x IQR. The Z-score method flags absolute scores greater than 3.\n",
    "\n",
    "The notebook reports the number and share of app rows flagged by each method. Separate analysis copies demonstrate removal and capping, and summary statistics are compared before and after. The original install values are never overwritten."
   ]
